OL,3,GNEWSAAnimal sanctuary wins planning
OL,4,Afight to stay
OL,5,
OL,6,FBeverley Alderton-Sambrook, from the
OL,7,Fcentre, told Rotherham Council's
OL,8,Fplanning board that it had provided
OL,9,Ftemporary care for animals on behalf of
OL,10,Forganisations including the RSPCA.
OL,12,FDespite the application being opposed
OL,13,Fby some neighbours, the council found
OL,14,Fthe animals were well cared for and
OL,15,Fpermission was granted.
